# P6 round 4: the Master Inserts page on Tracker+. Shift + Saturation (F6) on the Master screen opens the page, Down in the Insert 1 list picks Dirt (its parameter Drive shows)
# (the only master insert on the flow's card), which also switches the Saturation to Inserts. The Master key cycle then reaches the Inserts stop.
# plus_flows.sh stages the card (/Plugins/Master/dirt.plg, the pinned effects-os file) and reads the slot afterwards: `inserts` must say 1=running:Dirt.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Master Inserts on Tracker+ (P6 r4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

use boot-to-pattern
tap Master
wait 800ms
use shift-tap key=F6 wait=1s
expect text "Inserts"
tap F2
wait 500ms
tap Down
wait 3000ms
expect text "Drive"
shot dirt-picked
use goto-pattern
use goto-master title="Inserts"
expect text "Drive"
shot inserts-cycle
